{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#card-zh","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 是供 DSH Web 对话使用的交互卡片插件。它注册 visual 工具，并在消息流中呈现 HTML 卡片或可编辑流程图；工具会等待用户提交后再把结果交回会话。用户可以点击卡片动作、填写字段、保存脚本状态、右键添加带定位信息的评论，也可以拖动和调整流程图节点与连线。卡片支持自定义标题、尺寸、动作和等待时限，提交内容作为工具结果返回。适合需要在 DSH 对话中审阅内容、收集选择和备注，或共同修改流程图的场景。安装需要兼容版本的 DSH、Web 客户端和 Node.js 20 或更高版本，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:97-206","lib/client.js:461-532","lib/client.js:715-723","package.json:25-40"]}
{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#card-en","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-visual renders interactive HTML cards and editable flowcharts in DSH Web chats. Its visual tool waits for a user submission and returns actions, form fields, and comments. Users can also edit diagram nodes and edges. Requires compatible DSH and Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:97-206","lib/client.js:461-532","lib/client.js:715-723","package.json:25-40"]}
