{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#feature-1","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 的功能「交互式 HTML 卡片」：在对话消息中呈现模型提供的 HTML 内容。用户点击标记的动作或提交字段后，卡片将动作、字段和评论作为结果交回；工具在用户提交前保持等待。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:179-196","lib/client.js:486-514"]}
{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#feature-2","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 的功能「流程图编辑」：传入节点和连线后显示可调整的流程图。用户可以拖动、重命名、连接或删除图中元素，完成后交还编辑后的图结构。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-145","lib/client.js:359-389","lib/client.js:715-723"]}
{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#feature-3","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 的功能「卡片评论」：用户可以在 HTML 卡片中的元素上右键添加文字意见。评论会关联元素定位信息，并随提交内容返回，帮助模型理解意见对应的位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:534-590","lib/client.js:605-609"]}
{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#feature-4","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 的功能「等待时限与取消」：卡片工具可以设置等待时长，默认等待十分钟并将范围限制在一秒到一小时。等待超时或会话取消时，工具返回相应结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-11","lib/index.js:59-73","lib/index.js:153-156"]}
{"unit_id":"MjxUpUp__dsh-visual#caveat-1","repo":"MjxUpUp/dsh-visual","commit":"ce1647a37277fd1df29f2833ad2d9181ea74fd30","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-visual 使用须知：HTML 卡片脚本的行为说明存在不一致：README 说脚本会运行，但工具参数描述称脚本会被移除，浏览器端实现则会执行卡片内联脚本。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:78-81","lib/index.js:108-112","lib/client.js:205-215"]}
